  "text_sanskrit": "ततः पदं तत्परिमार्गितव्यं यस्मिन्गता न निवर्तन्ति भूयः । तमेव चाद्यं पुरुषं प्रपद्ये । यतः प्रवृत्तिः प्रसृता पुराणी ॥ १५-४ ॥",
  "itrans": "tataH padaM tatparimArgitavyaM yasmingatA na nivartanti bhUyaH . tameva chAdyaM puruShaM prapadye . yataH pravR^ittiH prasR^itA purANI .. 15-4 ..",
  "translation": "Thereafter That goal should be investigated into, where, having gone, the souls do not come back again. And that first Purusha along one should resort to, from whom the stream of Samsara has expanded (flowed) of old.",
